<title>MOROCCO: SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT EGYPT 1-0 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-MOROCCO BEAT EGYPT 1-0 IN AFRICA CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>RABAT 1997-06-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morocco beat Egypt 1-0 (halftime 0-0) in an African Nations Cup group three qualifier on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorer: Salaheddine Bassir 71</p>
<p>Attendance: 80,000</p>
</text>
